helping with the labs,

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:21.960
and like you know I test on her

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:22.873
and I'm like, "Mom I need your help."

00:06:22.873 --> 00:06:23.960
She does everything.

00:06:23.960 --> 00:06:25.070
My dad also does everything.

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:26.920
They run the business side of it.

00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:27.753
- We're like good cop bad cop.

00:06:27.753 --> 00:06:29.968
- (laughs) Yeah.

00:06:29.968 --> 00:06:31.530
I'm the creative.

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:33.129
- Don't have yes people,
have the no people.

00:06:33.129 --> 00:06:33.962
