00:07:18.795 --> 00:07:20.570
(all laugh)

00:07:20.570 --> 00:07:22.170
I love it.

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:24.293
Why is it so important for
y'all to share your story?

00:07:24.293 --> 00:07:25.760
Because I know you love doing makeup,

00:07:25.760 --> 00:07:27.260
but this story is a big part of it.

00:07:27.260 --> 00:07:29.110
Like I think that's really important.

00:07:29.110 --> 00:07:31.070
- I think for me the
most important part is,

00:07:31.070 --> 00:07:31.960
I have a platform.

00:07:31.960 --> 00:07:33.470
You know, I have millions
of followers that watch me,

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:34.860
