00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:41.730
It does become easier as time progresses,

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:43.347
and I know I feel like
when you're in high school,

00:07:43.347 --> 00:07:45.900
it feels like, oh my god, this
is how it's gonna be forever.

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:46.733
You know, and it's not the case.

00:07:46.733 --> 00:07:49.270
And I went through hard times.

00:07:49.270 --> 00:07:50.150
Me and my dad both went through

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:52.385
really really hard times together,

00:07:52.385 --> 00:07:53.218
and now on the other end,

00:07:53.218 --> 00:07:54.106
