00:07:54.106 --> 00:07:56.250
I'm a CEO, I own Lunar Beauty,

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:57.690
and he works with me, ya know.

00:07:57.690 --> 00:07:59.810
And my mom works with me,
and it's like so awesome,

00:07:59.810 --> 00:08:01.450
and I want people to know that

00:08:01.450 --> 00:08:03.780
it is going to get better for you,

00:08:03.780 --> 00:08:04.780
if you try.

00:08:04.780 --> 00:08:06.170
- Why is it so important to you, Manny?

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:08.738
- For me, I think I just wanna show kids

00:08:08.738 --> 00:08:10.513
that are struggling
right now with parents,

00:08:10.513 --> 00:08:12.590
that there's hope.

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:16.910
That people can change,
if given the opportunity.

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:18.890
Because there are so many kids out there

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:21.410
that are struggling, and
going through dark times,

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:23.037
that don't have that love and support

00:08:23.037 --> 00:08:25.710
that they need at home.

00:08:25.710 --> 00:08:28.791
So for all the parents out
there that are struggling,

00:08:28.791 --> 00:08:31.110
your kids need you.

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:32.190
- Yeah, they need you to love them.

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:33.023
- [Manny Sr.] Yeah, they do.

00:08:33.023 --> 00:08:34.000
- How they are.

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:34.833
(crowd claps)

00:08:34.833 --> 00:08:35.680
Not who you want them to be.

